# docs/ is ignored wholesale (it predates the hand-written design docs that now live
# there). Git can't re-include a file under an excluded directory, hence docs/* + an
# explicit allow-list. Add any design doc that should survive a clone.
docs/*
!docs/I18N_DATA_LAYER_DESIGN.md
!docs/AI_TOOL_CALLING_DESIGN.md
!docs/FEATURES.md
!docs/SETUP.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/API.md
!docs/LOCATION_SEARCH.md
!docs/NEXT_WORK_PROMPT.md
# docs/archive/ (the pre-2026 location notes + QUICKSTART) stays ignored.
# Design preview (throwaway)
frontend/ledger-preview.html
**/*/package-lock.json

# RAG embedding cache — derived from rag_corpus/*.jsonl, rebuilt on demand.
backend/rag_corpus/.index.json

# Family birth data used only by local JHora cross-checks (tests/test_yoga_catalog.py)
backend/tests/private_*.json
